Listed all possible drops if the player spin this gacha. It requires [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsules|Lucky Tickets]] to spin, which can be obtained from some of the annual [[:Category:Seasonal Event|Seasonal Events]]. Alternatively, it can be drawn from once per day by viewing an advertisement.

